{{define "title"}}Account Deleted{{end}}

{{define "content"}}
<h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-top: 0;">We're sorry to see you go</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0;">Hi {{.HostName}},</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0;">This email confirms that your QueueBuzz account has been permanently deleted as requested. All your data has been removed from our systems.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0;">We're always looking to improve. If you have a moment, we'd love to hear why you decided to leave. Just reply to this email and let us know.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0;">Thank you for using QueueBuzz. We wish you the best!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0;">Best regards,<br>The QueueBuzz Team</p>
{{end}}

{{template "layout" .}}
